---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const site = 'https://toiletsnearme.pages.dev';
---
<Base title="Privacy — Toilets Near Me"
  description="What Toilets Near Me collects, why it is used, and your privacy choices."
  canonical={site + '/privacy/'}
  jsonld={[{ '@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'WebPage', name:'Privacy — Toilets Near Me', url: site + '/privacy/' }]}>
  <section class="wrap py-12">
    <h1 class="text-[32px] font-extrabold tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      You can browse the directory without creating an account. We do not ask for your name,
      phone number or precise location to view toilet listings.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-[22px] font-extrabold">Feedback you choose to submit</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      An optional feedback prompt may appear after a delay. If you submit an answer, we receive
      the feedback text or selected option, the page path (without query strings), and the
      submission time. We do not record prompt impressions, dismissals, referrer URLs, browser
      user-agent strings or a session identifier through this feedback feature. If you close or
      ignore the prompt, no feedback record is sent. Please do not include sensitive personal
      information in feedback.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-[22px] font-extrabold">Voice input</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      If you choose voice input, your browser's speech-recognition feature converts speech to
      text. Processing may be provided by your browser or its speech service. We receive only
      the resulting text if you choose to submit it; you can edit it before sending or use text
      input instead.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-[22px] font-extrabold">Local browser storage</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      We use local browser storage to remember that the optional feedback prompt was shown,
      so it is not shown again for 24 hours. This setting stays in your browser and is not sent
      to our database.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-[22px] font-extrabold">Analytics, advertising and third parties</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      We use Google Analytics to understand site usage. Advertising is provided by Monetag and
      may involve third-party scripts, cookies or similar technologies. These providers may
      process technical information such as IP address, browser/device information and ad
      interactions under their own privacy policies. Map tiles are provided by OpenStreetMap
      contributors. Your browser connects to these providers when the relevant features load.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-[22px] font-extrabold">Your choices and requests</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[15px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      You can skip the feedback prompt, disable browser storage, or use browser controls to
      restrict cookies and third-party content. To ask about feedback you submitted or request
      its deletion, write to
      <a class="underline" href="mailto:skmstudio.services@gmail.com">skmstudio.services@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      This notice describes the current site implementation and may be updated when features
      or service providers change.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
